          "end": 809.039,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "My",
          "start": 809.039,
          "end": 809.305,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messenger\",",
          "start": 809.305,
          "end": 809.57,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "so",
          "start": 809.57,
          "end": 809.835,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "obviously",
          "start": 809.835,
          "end": 810.1,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "this",
          "start": 810.1,
          "end": 810.365,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "is",
          "start": 810.365,
          "end": 810.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God",
          "start": 810.63,
          "end": 810.895,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "speaking.",
          "start": 810.895,
          "end": 811.16,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Lo, I am sending My messenger to prepare the way before Me; and suddenly there will come to the temple the Lord whom you seek, and the messenger of the covenant whom you desire.",
