        },
        {
          "word": "all.",
          "start": 1217.533,
          "end": 1217.733,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The \"One and Only\" is the same as the Great, or the Forgiver, or the Merciful.",
