    },
    {
      "text": "This page says \"On the 27th night of Ramadan, 13 B.H. (Before Hijra) (610A.D.), the prophet Muhammad was summoned to the highest possible point,",
      "start": 1302.334,
      "end": 1311.294,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
