          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "A.D.\"",
          "start": 1326.975,
          "end": 1327.374,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And we have the verse.",
      "start": 1327.928,
      "end": 1329.065,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "And",
          "start": 1327.928,
          "end": 1328.155,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "we",
          "start": 1328.155,
          "end": 1328.383,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "have",
          "start": 1328.383,
          "end": 1328.61,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 1328.61,
          "end": 1328.838,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "verse.",
          "start": 1328.838,
          "end": 1329.065,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"At the moment of release, Muhammad scrupulously wrote it down with his own hand. It has been divinely guarded since then (See Appendices 1 and 28).",
      "start": 1329.065,
      "end": 1338.945,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "\"At",
          "start": 1329.065,
          "end": 1329.445,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "the",
          "start": 1329.445,
          "end": 1329.825,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "moment",
          "start": 1329.825,
          "end": 1330.205,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "of",
          "start": 1330.205,
          "end": 1330.585,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
