          "end": 1445.447,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"One may ask why did God wait all this time to perfect and consolidate his message?",
      "start": 1445.447,
      "end": 1450.685,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
