          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "world.",
          "start": 1462.757,
          "end": 1463.046,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"It is a matter of simple statistics that the world's population from the beginning until now did not exceed 6 billion.",
