          "word": "Moses,",
          "start": 1550.104,
          "end": 1550.377,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "remember?",
          "start": 1550.377,
          "end": 1550.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pharaoh said \"what about all those people in the past? Why are you coming to tell us about God this and that?\"",
