          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "is",
          "start": 1561.075,
          "end": 1561.401,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "with",
          "start": 1561.401,
          "end": 1561.727,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "God",
          "start": 1561.727,
          "end": 1562.053,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "in",
          "start": 1562.053,
          "end": 1562.378,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "a",
          "start": 1562.378,
          "end": 1562.704,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "record.\"",
          "start": 1562.704,
          "end": 1563.03,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's their business.",
      "start": 1563.03,
      "end": 1564.997,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "Yeah,",
          "start": 1563.03,
          "end": 1563.522,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that's",
          "start": 1563.522,
          "end": 1564.014,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "their",
          "start": 1564.014,
          "end": 1564.505,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "business.",
          "start": 1564.505,
          "end": 1564.997,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"It all began a few billion years ago when one of God's high-ranking creatures, Satan,",
      "start": 1566.997,
      "end": 1572.357,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "\"It",
