    },
    {
      "text": "\"It is, it is only logical that members of God's kingdom must uphold God's absolute authority.",
      "start": 1762.417,
      "end": 1768.938,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "\"It",
