          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "their",
          "start": 2726.793,
          "end": 2727.244,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "decisions.\"",
          "start": 2727.244,
          "end": 2727.696,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Every person is born with instinctive knowledge that God alone and no one else is our Lord and Master (7:172-173).\"",
