        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Additionally, God sent messengers to deliver messages, warnings, and abundant information to help us redeem ourselves.\"",
      "start": 2739.822,
      "end": 2747.809,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": "\"Additionally,",
