          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "last.\"",
          "start": 2827.818,
          "end": 2828.268,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He didn't say \"Thank Jesus\", or anything like that.",
