          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "that.",
          "start": 2830.413,
          "end": 2830.635,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Malcolm X, who discovered the true Islam, also was taken two months before his 40th birthday.",
