          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "Quran.",
          "start": 3256.391,
          "end": 3256.809,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"It was far beyond Muhammad the human or any collection of humans at the time of revelation of the Quran",
      "start": 3256.809,
      "end": 3262.352,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
