          "end": 3591.132,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "messengers.",
          "start": 3591.132,
          "end": 3591.562,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"If the object of worship is one and the same, there will be absolute unity among all believers.",
      "start": 3591.562,
      "end": 3597.411,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
