          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": "believers.",
          "start": 3597.086,
          "end": 3597.411,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"It is the human factor that is devotion to such powerless humans as Jesus, Muhammad, and the saints",
      "start": 3597.411,
      "end": 3603.076,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
