        },
        {
          "word": "prevail.",
          "start": 3647.957,
          "end": 3648.4,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"This is not wishful thinking, this is God's inviolable law, as decreed in 3:19, 41:53, and Sura 110.",
