    {
      "text": "\"[2:62]  Surely, those who are Jewish, the Christians, and the converts; anyone who (1) believes in GOD, (2) believes in the Last Day, and (3) leads a righteous life, will receive their recompense from their Lord. They have nothing to fear, nor will they grieve.\"",
