    {
      "text": "[1:1]  In the name of GOD, Most Gracious, Most Merciful.* [1:2]  Praise be to GOD, Lord of the universe. [1:3]  Most Gracious, Most Merciful. [1:4]  Master of the Day of Judgment. [1:5]  Only You we worship; Only You we ask for help. [1:6]  Guide us in the right path; [1:7]  the path of those whom You blessed; not of those who have deserved wrath, nor the strayers.",
