          "speaker": "Kathryn"
        },
        {
          "word": "times,",
          "start": 3842.167,
          "end": 3843.159,
          "speaker": "Kathryn"
        },
        {
          "word": "respectively.",
          "start": 3843.159,
          "end": 3844.152,
          "speaker": "Kathryn"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Thus, the reader is handed out at the outset, handed out at outset, tangible proof that this is not a human-made book.",
