    {
      "text": "[5:12] GOD had taken a covenant from the Children of Israel, and we raised among them twelve patriarchs. And GOD said, \"I am with you, so long as you observe the Contact Prayers (Salat), and give the obligatory charity (Zakat), and believe in My messengers and respect them, and continue to lend GOD a loan of righteousness. I will then remit your sins, and admit you into gardens with flowing streams. Anyone who disbelieves after this, has indeed strayed off the right path.\"",
      "start": 4153.626,
      "end": 4185.0,
      "speaker": "Kathryn",
