    {
      "text": "[3:167]  And to expose the hypocrites who were told, \"Come fight in the cause of GOD, or contribute.\" They said, \"If we knew how to fight, we would have followed you.\" They were closer to disbelief than belief on that day. They uttered with their mouths what was not in their hearts. GOD knows whatever they conceal.",
